  { icon: "heart", t: "Women’s programs", bar: "#b6863c", d: `The <a class="inl" href="/programs/womens-wellness-iop/">Women’s Wellness IOP</a> runs morning and evening groups at 300 Hebron Ave and in Westbrook.` },
  { icon: "compass", t: "The shoreline", bar: "#2f76c4", d: `Our <a class="inl" href="/location/westbrook-ct/">Westbrook office</a> serves Old Saybrook, Clinton, Madison, Guilford, Branford and nearby shoreline towns with adult IOP (including an evening group), Women’s Wellness IOP, therapy and medication management. Evening IOP is also offered at 300 Hebron Ave in Glastonbury.` },
