---

<Base title="Mental Health Clinics in Connecticut | 6 Hopewell Offices" description="Six Hopewell offices in Glastonbury, South Glastonbury, West Hartford, East Hampton and Westbrook, CT. See which programs each offers. Check coverage." canonical={canonical} image={P + "downtown-glastonbury-sign.webp"}>
  <Header />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({ "@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "ItemList", name: "Hopewell Health Solutions locations", itemListElement: locations.map((l, i) => ({ "@type": "ListItem", position: i + 1, name: `Hopewell Health Solutions ${l.name}`, url: `https://www.hopewellhealthsolutions.com/location/${l.slug}/` })) })} />
  <main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="hw">
    <!-- Hero: the office buildings rotate as the banner background (user 2026-11-17), then a self-moving whole-photo gallery under it -->
    <section class="wq-hero lh-hero">
      <div class="hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
        {heroHouses.map((h, i) => <img class:list={["hero-slide", i === 0 && "is-active"]} src={h.src} alt="" width={h.w ?? 1200} height={h.h ?? 900} style={`object-position:${h.pos ?? "center"}`} fetchpriority={i === 0 ? "high" : "low"} loading={i === 0 ? "eager" : "lazy"} decoding="async" />)}
      </div>
      <div class="hero-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="container wq-hero-grid">
        <div>
          <nav class="wq-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <span>Locations</span></nav>
          <h1>Mental Health Clinics in Connecticut: Our Offices</h1>
          <p class="lede">Six offices, one trusted team, and telehealth wherever you are.</p>
          <ul class="wq-facts">
            {heroUsps.slice(0, 3).map((u) => <li><Icon name={u.icon} class="h-[18px] w-[18px]" />{u.t}</li>)}
          </ul>
          <div class="wq-ctas"><a href="tel:8607351448" class="btn btn-blue only-d"><Icon name="phone" />Call (860) 735-1448</a><a href="#by-location" class="btn wq-ghost">Find a program near you</a></div>
          <HeroCreds />
        </div>
        <p class="lh-hero-now" aria-live="off"><Icon name="pin" class="h-4 w-4" /><span>{heroHouses[0].cap}</span></p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <Creds />
    <!-- Office gallery under the accreditations (user 2026-11-17): self-moving, whole photos -->
    <section class="section is-white lh-gal" aria-label="Photos of our offices">
      <PhotoSlider mode="marquee" photos={officeGallery} label="Photos of Hopewell's six Connecticut offices" />
    </section>

    <OfficeFinder tone="stone" />

    <!-- Overview -->
    <section class="section is-white" id="overview">
      <div class="container ab-story">
        <aside class="lh-glance" aria-label="Hopewell at a glance">
          <p class="lh-glance-tag">Hopewell at a glance</p>
          <ul>
            <li><span class="lh-glance-ico"><Icon name="pin" class="h-6 w-6" /></span><strong>6</strong><span>offices in Hartford County, Middlesex County and the shoreline</span></li>
            <li><span class="lh-glance-ico"><Icon name="calendar" class="h-6 w-6" /></span><strong>2013</strong><span>founded in Glastonbury, Connecticut</span></li>
            <li><span class="lh-glance-ico"><Icon name="star" class="h-6 w-6" /></span><strong>4.8<em>★</em></strong><span>on Google, from 368 reviews</span></li>
            <li><span class="lh-glance-ico"><Icon name="users" class="h-6 w-6" /></span><strong>4<em>+</em></strong><span>ages served, children through adults</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="lh-glance-foot"><Icon name="shield" class="h-5 w-5" />Joint Commission accredited</p>
        </aside>
        <div class="ab-copy">
          <h2>Mental health &amp; psychiatry, close to home across Connecticut</h2>
          {/* Long intro (user 2026-11-18: "a lot of text"): 4 key points, the full text folds behind "Read more". */}
          <ul class="lh-keys">
            <li><Icon name="pin" class="h-5 w-5" /><span><strong>Six offices</strong> across Hartford County and the shoreline, plus <a class="inl" href="#telehealth">telehealth</a></span></li>
            <li><Icon name="shield" class="h-5 w-5" /><span><strong>Since 2013</strong>, a <a class="inl" href="/about-us/">Joint Commission–accredited</a> practice rated 4.8 on Google</span></li>
            <li><Icon name="users" class="h-5 w-5" /><span><a class="inl" href="/programs/counseling/">Therapy</a>, <a class="inl" href="/programs/medication-management/">medication management</a>, <a class="inl" href="/programs/intensive-outpatient-program/">IOP</a> and <a class="inl" href="/programs/partial-hospitalization-program/">PHP</a> under one roof</span></li>
            <li><Icon name="refresh" class="h-5 w-5" /><span>Step up or down in care without starting over with a new practice</span></li>
          </ul>
          <div class="sp-fold lh-fold" id="lh-more">
            <p>Hopewell Health Solutions has grown into an accessible outpatient mental health and psychiatry practice, with <strong>six offices</strong> spanning Hartford County and the shoreline, three in Glastonbury, plus West Hartford, East Hampton, and Westbrook. Wherever you are in the state, compassionate, evidence-based care is close to home, and when getting to an office isn’t practical, secure telehealth brings the same trusted team to you.</p>
            <p>Since 2013, we’ve built our reputation on a simple idea: change is a practice, not a concept. Our clinicians fuse psychology, psychiatry, and whole-person wellness into care that’s active, collaborative, and tailored to each person. Across every location you’ll find the same standard of care, a <a href="/about-us/" class="inl">Joint Commission–accredited practice</a> with a 4.8-star reputation and a team of <a href="/about-us/team/" class="inl">psychiatrists, board-certified nurse practitioners, psychologists, and licensed therapists</a> who genuinely listen.</p>
            <p>Each office offers the support most people need most often: <a href="/programs/counseling/" class="inl">individual, couples, and family therapy</a> and <a href="/programs/medication-management/" class="inl">medication management</a>. Across the practice we also provide our <a href="/programs/intensive-outpatient-program/" class="inl">Intensive Outpatient Program (IOP)</a> and <a href="/programs/partial-hospitalization-program/" class="inl">Partial Hospitalization Program (PHP)</a>, plus specialized treatments such as <a href="/treatment-methods/tms/" class="inl">TMS</a> and <a href="/treatment-methods/neuropsychological-testing/" class="inl">neuropsychological and ADHD testing</a>. Because all of it lives under one roof, you can step up or down between levels of care, or add a service, without ever having to start over with a new practice.</p>
            <p>We treat the <a href="/what-we-treat/" class="inl">full range of mental health and behavioral concerns</a>: depression, anxiety, trauma and PTSD, ADHD, OCD, and bipolar disorder, with <a href="/what-we-treat/substance-use-disorder/" class="inl">addiction</a> and co-occurring care at our Downtown Glastonbury and Westbrook offices. We welcome individuals of every age, background, and identity, and we work hard to make starting easy, we accept all major insurance providers, and our team <a href="/rates-and-insurance-coverage/" class="inl">verifies your benefits for free</a> before your first visit. Choose the office nearest you below, or call <a href="tel:8607351448" class="inl">(860) 735-1448</a> and we’ll help you find the right location, provider, and level of care.</p>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="sp-more" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="lh-more">Read more</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

